  "description": {
    "text": "The 2011 Pokémon World Championships, held from 12 to 14 August 2011 at the Hilton San Diego Bayfront. Competitors got the first Tropical Beach in seven languages, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Finalist.\n\nThe top three of each age division received No. 1 to No. 3 Trainer trophy cards, now Item cards in the Black & White era's frame, with the rule \"Play only one No. 1 Trainer card per year.\" added to their text.",
